Hi <%= @user.name %>,

Someone (hopefully you) asked to reset your Bookshelf password. Open this link to choose a new one:

<%= edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>

This link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email - your password won't change.
